  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large mixing bowl, whisk together flour, baking powder, and salt.",
    "Add butter and mix until a dough forms.",
    "Knead the dough for 5 minutes until smooth.",
    "Place dough in a greased 9x13-inch baking dish.",
    "Mix together cheddar cheese, Turkish Delight, and kale in a separate bowl.",
    "Spread cheese mixture evenly over dough.",
    "Pour almond milk over cheese mixture.",
    "Bake for 35 minutes or until the crust is golden brown and the cheese is melted and bubbly."
